{"ID":"20240118151315-ze7pctw","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151315-ze7pctw","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151315-ze7pctw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151315-c5i3h7v\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122093650-ha1xla1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122093650-ha1xla1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:430,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:430\u0026#125;","title":"075地肤子","type":"doc","updated":"20240129160344"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151315-c5i3h7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151315-c5i3h7v","updated":"20240122093629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦寒，主膀胱热，利小便，补中益精气，久服耳聪目明，轻身耐老。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122093632-gom9ffk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122093632-gom9ffk"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】生田野间，处处有之，子落则老茎可以为少帚，故又名落帚。（西充叫铁扫把）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122093634-v5kaxfa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122093634-v5kaxfa"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦性寒。无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122093636-9efwjra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122093636-9efwjra"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】地肤子为利小便要药，主膀胱热，通利五淋，强阴益精，治下焦虚而有热良。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122093639-f1bs5b6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122093639-f1bs5b6"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】主皮肤中热气，使人润泽，散恶疮疝瘕，强阴。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122093641-ctcz1c1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122093641-ctcz1c1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治阴卵颓疾；去风热，可做汤沐浴，与阳起石同服，主丈夫阴痿不起，补气益力。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122093643-dnq09ju","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122093643-dnq09ju"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【日华】治客热丹肿。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122093645-y1s1rxf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122093645-y1s1rxf"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至二三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122093646-np8zo6a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122093646-np8zo6a"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】老人小便短而频数，是膀胱气化不足，小肠火偏弱也，法当补小肠火；如乌药艾叶，不可独用地肤子。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122093648-t5luyvd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122093648-t5luyvd"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【附录】地肤子煎——煎水洗目，去热暗雀盲涩痛，煎水服利小便诸淋，解恶疮。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122093625-zkdcwdm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122093625-zkdcwdm"}},{"ID":"20240122093650-yw7qby8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122093650-yw7qby8"}},{"ID":"20240122093650-ha1xla1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122093650-ha1xla1","updated":"20240129160344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第75味药，地肤子，它又名叫做落帚，就我们扫帚啊，扫把，他那个枝掉光了以后啊，老的茎我们可以收集起来做成扫把，可以扫地用，这个味道是苦寒的，苦寒的药，它味是苦寒，那寒呢能够去热，比如说小便发炎哪，小便刺痛哪，都可以用，苦味呢能够泻，所以说它是非常好…膀胱…比如说小便刺痛哦，都可以用哦。那是利小便的药，但是这个利小便一定是炎症，膀胱里边发炎刺痛了，有尿道炎哪，我们使用的，膀胱结石啊，也可以使用。那个甄权呢，如果说，你如果阴囊，睾丸呢有比较肿大，就可以用这个地肤子，也可以做汤来洗也可以内服，和阳起石同用，用来治，专门治疗阳痿。象那个禁忌，是我给他补进去的。那有的老年人频尿，你不要给他吃这个地肤子，因为地肤子本身寒凉的嘛，一吃这个频尿越频，那小肠火偏弱，老人呢这个频尿是因为里寒，这个时候像我们常常用到乌药、艾叶，艾草的艾叶哦都可以，去里寒小肠的寒，这个时候你不要用地肤子。那地肤子呢可以煮汤水，我们有好几位中药可以煮汤水来洗眼睛，专门治疗眼科的发炎，这个很好，效果很好。"}]}]}